{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a434c6a1198c78a5a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Branch-and-Price (B&P) / Column Generation 在 2D facility placement / packing 类问题上的具体公式化。\n\n**背景：** Round 3 提过 column generation 但因结构不匹配排除。这次深挖：是否有专门为 placement 设计的 column 形式（如 line-pattern, region-pattern, configuration-based），跟我们 Benders 范式互补？\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. B&P for 2D bin packing / strip packing 经典公式\n2. Pattern-based column（每条 line 是一个 column）\n3. Stabilized column generation\n4. B&P + LBBD 混合\n5. 现代工具：BaPCod, GCG, SCIP-Jack\n6. 跟我们 binding/routing 的对偶\n7. Master 弱 LP 松弛是否能用 B&P 收紧\n\n输出末尾：\"是否值得 PoC + 具体公式建议\""},"uuid":"a2a74cee-c84a-4464-961a-bbe005ec41c4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:07.424Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
